// The module-build entry: re-exports the complete host ABI — the embedding surface
// the Rust host calls, the deno corpus harness, and the LSP query families — so
// `vl build compiler/entry.vl` yields a compiler wasm with bare, stable export
// names. The set is the union of the public exports of driver, cli, lint, the
// typecheck LSP families, the host emit opt-ins and the optimizer passes, each
// kept bare.
